                "textId": "Performance_1999990021_1583457704_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "你还需要吗？\n可以去海里捞回来，顺便我游个泳。",
              "content_l10n": {
